OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 8 DEC
OL,4,G1930FJo Whiley
OL,5,     GJo handpicks her favourite new
OL,6,     Gmusic from all genres of the
OL,7,     Gmusical spectrum and quality
OL,8,     Gvintage songs too.
OL,9,G2100FThe Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
OL,10,     GCerys unwraps a festive gift from
OL,11,     Gthe BBC Archive: BB King's
OL,12,     GChristmas Blues! Recorded in 1997
OL,13,     Gwith the late Johnnie Walker,
OL,14,     GB.B. King shares some of his
OL,15,     Gfavourite records!
OL,16,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,17,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,18,     Ggroove. 'Dr. Beat' is also on
OL,19,     Ghand to prescribe a perfect tune
OL,20,     Gfor a listener whose week hasn't
OL,21,     Ggot off to the best start!
